# StreamVersion 1.2
# --position=0 cannot be applied, and the warning it raises lights the bell of the viewport
# tool group with an unread count. Clicking the bell opens the message center on that warning
# and clears the count. (The bell replaced the console's "!" badge this test used to click.)
RenderEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
